Comforts for Sunrise (version 0.5.0)

A port of Comforts 26.x by Illusive Soulworks.
Original source: https://github.com/illusivesoulworks/comforts
Original licence: LGPL-3.0-or-later

Block models for sleeping bags and hammocks are adapted from the initial port
assets by lavoide; the gameplay rules, recipes, config, and Sunrise integration are
implemented for Sunrise's native mod API by arismoko.

This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (LGPL-3.0-or-later);
the full licence texts are in COPYING and COPYING.LESSER (copied as LICENSE).
